sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant Backend
    participant Ollama

    User->>Frontend: Upload document
    Frontend->>Backend: POST upload
    Backend->>Backend: Clean and chunk text
    Backend->>Ollama: Embed chunks
    Ollama-->>Backend: Vectors
    Backend-->>Frontend: Upload complete

    User->>Frontend: Ask question
    Frontend->>Backend: POST query
    Backend->>Ollama: Embed question
    Ollama-->>Backend: Query vector
    Backend->>Backend: Rank similar chunks
    Backend->>Ollama: Ask chat model with retrieved context
    Ollama-->>Backend: Grounded answer
    Backend-->>Frontend: Answer + citations

